{"id":"NCT06911632","title":"Multi-site Study of the Clinical Impact of an AI-assisted Approach to Referring Patients With Interstitial Lung Disease for Diagnostic Evaluation of Pulmonary Hypertension","official":"MOMENTOUS Study (iMpact Of an Ecg ai ModEl oN The Diagnosis Of pUlmonary hypertenSion)","summary":"MOMENTOUS is a multi-center, randomized study to prospectively evaluate the performance of an ECG-based AI device to predict whether participants with interstitial lung disease (ILD) are at high risk of undiagnosed pulmonary hypertension.","conditions":["Pulmonary Hypertension","Interstitial Lung Disease (ILD)"],"interventions":[{"type":"DEVICE","name":"ECG-based AI Device - Results Returned to Investigator"},{"type":"PROCEDURE","name":"Echocardiogram and Right Heart Catheterization"},{"type":"DEVICE","name":"ECG-based AI Device - Results Not Returned to Investigator"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* 18 years or older at the time of consent\n* A known diagnosis of interstitial lung disease\n* Diffusing capacity for carbon monoxide (DLCO) \\<30% predicted, collected within 6 months prior to consent\n* Willing and able to provide informed consent and undergo all study-specific procedures, including echo and RHC, if required\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* A known diagnosis of pulmonary hypertension (including patients prescribed a therapy specifically for pulmonary arterial hypertension (PAH))\n* A RHC was completed within the previous 1 year or ordered and not yet completed at the time of consent\n* LV ejection fraction ≤ 40% on most recent echo or cardiac MRI, if available\n* Unclassifiable Tempus PH ECG risk result after up to 2 ECG acquisitions\n* A contraindication to RHC exists (for example, pregnancy or mechanical right heart valve)\n* Physician decision that if a patient is directed to RHC by the study protocol, the potential risks of RHC outweigh the potential benefits\n* There is a severe concomitant illness limiting life expectancy to less than 6 months (at the discretion of the investigator)\n* There is a medical or social factor that makes the patient a poor candidate for the study and/or unlikely to be able to comply with the study protocol or complete study procedures (at the discretion of the investigator)","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"DIAGNOSTIC","enrollment":900,"start":"2025-07-23","pcd":"2028-05","upd":"2026-11-03","sponsor":"Tempus AI","areas":["other"],"central":["Momentous Study · (833) 514-4187 · momentous-study@tempus.com"],"sites":[{"f":"University of Alabama at Birmingham","city":"Birmingham","pr":"Alabama","zip":"35205","s":"R","lat":33.5207,"lon":-86.8025,"c":"Andrea Ford · 205-0934-8904 · afcook@uabmc.edu"},{"f":"Banner University Medical Center","city":"Phoenix","pr":"Arizona","zip":"84006","s":"R","lat":33.4484,"lon":-112.074,"c":"Clinical Research Coordinator · 602-521-6400 · slmarch@arizona.edu"},{"f":"Dignity Health - St. Joseph's Hospital and Medical Center-Norton Thoracic Institute","city":"Phoenix","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85013","s":"R","lat":33.4484,"lon":-112.074,"c":"Dominique Robertson · 602-406-1295 · dominique.robertson900@commonspirit.org"},{"f":"University of Arkansas","city":"Little Rock","pr":"Arkansas","zip":"72205","s":"R","lat":34.7465,"lon":-92.2896,"c":"Clinical Research Coordinator · 501-214-2407 · blee4@uams.edu"},{"f":"HCA Riverside Community Hospital","city":"Riverside","pr":"California","zip":"92501","s":"R","lat":33.9534,"lon":-117.3962,"c":"Alazzeh · 423-737-2281 · aalazzeh@pacificpulm.com"},{"f":"National Jewish Health","city":"Denver","pr":"Colorado","zip":"80206","s":"R","lat":39.7392,"lon":-104.9847,"c":"Adrea Arthofer · 720-945-8608 · arthofera@NJHealth.org"},{"f":"AdventHealth Orlando","city":"Orlando","pr":"Florida","zip":"32803","s":"R","lat":28.5383,"lon":-81.3792,"c":"Kimberly Stark · 407-303-9984 · kimberly.stark@adventhealth.com"},{"f":"Northwestern University","city":"Chicago","pr